# How it works
content=hero('How TalentShare works','How to book<br>and <span class="serif">attend a class.</span>','Start by checking whether a program fits your goal, level, and schedule. You can read the details before signing up, then book and attend through your account.','workshop','Learners working together in a pottery studio',btn('Browse programs',APP))
content+=section(head('Start here','Four steps to your first session.')+steps())
content+=section('<div class="split"><div>'+eyebrow('Before you book')+'<h2>Check the details<br><span class="serif">before you book.</span></h2><p>Read what the program covers, who it is for, and what you need to take part.</p><p>Read the teacher’s profile and portfolio, and look at any reviews. If a requirement is unclear, use the program’s message option to ask. You can clarify experience or equipment requirements before paying.</p></div><div class="panel"><span class="mini-label">Your pre-booking checklist</span><h3>What to check</h3><ul class="feature-list light"><li>Level, outcomes, and prior knowledge</li><li>Online or in person, with the location where relevant</li><li>Every session included in your selected program</li><li>Materials, preparation, and the checkout total</li><li>The current cancellation policy</li></ul></div></div>','wash')
content+=section('<div class="split"><div class="image-wrap">'+img('code','People working together on a laptop','image-block')+'</div><div>'+eyebrow('Attending a session')+'<h2>Find your session<br><span class="serif">on the program page.</span></h2><p>For live online learning, open the schedule in your program and join from there. Confirmed learners can enter from 15 minutes before the start. Video, screen sharing, and live chat are built into TalentShare.</p><p>For in-person learning, use the program details to plan where to be and what to bring. Your schedule and teacher announcements remain with the program, so check them before heading out.</p><div class="actions">'+link('Explore the classroom features',u('/learning-experience/'))+'</div></div></div>')
content+=section(head('After the session','Find your files and follow-up questions','Access shared resources and stay in touch with your teacher between sessions.')+'<div class="two-grid"><div class="panel"><h3>Resources and conversation</h3><p>Download files your teacher has shared. Continue a question in the class discussion, or use a private message for something individual. Repeating dates in a program series share their discussion, announcements, and file library.</p></div><div class="panel"><h3>Your next session and your review</h3><p>Your learning dashboard separates upcoming, in-progress, and completed programs. Find what is next without sorting through old bookings. After a completed enrollment, you can leave a review from the dashboard.</p></div></div>')+closing()
page('/how-it-works/','How TalentShare Works | Find, Book & Attend Live Classes','Learn how to choose a TalentShare program, check the details, book a date, and attend online or in person. Find your schedule, resources, and messages in one place.','how TalentShare works',content)

# Experience
content=hero('The program experience','Ask during the session.<br><span class="serif">Keep learning afterward.</span>','A question can come up while you are watching a demonstration or later when you practise. Your program gives you ways to ask, find resources, and prepare for the next session.',action=btn('Explore programs',APP))
content+=section(head('Before your session','Know where to be and what to bring.')+'<div class="two-grid"><div class="panel"><h3>Prepare from one program page</h3><p>Check the full schedule, requirements, and shared materials. Online sessions show a timezone. In-person programs include location details.</p></div><div class="panel"><h3>Keep up with changes</h3><p>Read your provider’s announcements for official updates. Session reminders help you keep track of what is coming up, and your dashboard points to the next session.</p></div></div>','wash')
content+=section(f'<div class="split"><div>{eyebrow("During an online session")}<h2>Ask about the step<br><span class="serif">you did not follow.</span></h2><p>The teacher starts the session from the program schedule. You join from the same place, with your camera, microphone, and session chat in the room.</p><p>Watch a shared screen in stage view or see the people in the session in a grid. You can switch your microphone and speaker, turn your camera off, or use fullscreen when you want to focus.</p><p>If the connection drops, the room tries to reconnect. Access is limited to the teacher and confirmed learners.</p></div>{classroom()}</div>','dark')
content+=section(comms(),'wash')
content+=section(head('After a session','Find your course files and schedule')+'<div class="two-grid"><div class="panel"><span class="mini-label">Course resources</span><h3>Download course materials</h3><p>Teachers can share documents, slides, spreadsheets, images, audio, video, and other supporting files. Confirmed learners download those resources from the program. For a repeating series, one shared library serves its different dates.</p><p>Open the program page to find the files your teacher has shared.</p></div><div class="panel"><span class="mini-label">Schedule & reminders</span><h3>Know what is coming up</h3><p>The program lists its sessions, and your dashboard shows the next one. Reminders are sent before class and when it starts. Program updates and cancellations have their own notifications.</p><p>Online schedules carry a timezone. Read it when choosing a program, especially if the teacher is in another part of the world.</p></div></div>')
content+=section('<div class="split"><div class="image-wrap">'+img('workshop','A group learning pottery together in person','image-block')+'</div><div>'+eyebrow('In person, too')+'<h2>Attend a class<br><span class="serif">in person.</span></h2><p>For a hands-on workshop, a shared space can be part of the experience. TalentShare also supports in-person programs, with a venue, address, and session schedule.</p><p>You can still access your booking, course files, teacher announcements, and class discussion from the program page. Check the materials list so you arrive with what you need.</p><div class="actions">'+link('Find a subject to explore',u('/subjects/'))+'</div></div></div>')
content+=section(head('Your account','Use one account to learn and teach')+'<div class="two-grid"><p>You do not need a second account to move between learning and teaching. Apply to become a teacher from the account you already use. Once approved, your learning and teaching dashboards keep the two kinds of activity organised.</p><p>Your learning view holds upcoming, in-progress, and completed programs. Your teaching view brings together programs, students, the calendar, messages, and reports. You can switch between the two views in the same account.</p></div>','pinkwash')+closing()
