content=hero('For providers','You know your subject.<br><span class="serif">Help seekers find you.</span>','Turn your knowledge into a live program. Give seekers a clear way to see what you offer, book a place, and learn with you online or in person.','people','People sharing knowledge around a table',btn('Apply to become a provider',APP+'login')+link('How it works','#provider-process'))
content+=section(head('The work around teaching','A good program needs more<br>than a meeting link.',desc='You also need a way to reach seekers, explain the offer, and keep everything organised.')+'''<div class="problem-grid"><article><span class="problem-number">01</span><h3>Getting found</h3><p>Posting about your skill does not always help people understand what they can learn from you or how to book.</p></article><article><span class="problem-number">02</span><h3>Answering the same questions</h3><p>People need to know the level, schedule, materials, and price. Repeating those details in separate messages takes time.</p></article><article><span class="problem-number">03</span><h3>Keeping track of the program</h3><p>Enrollments, messages, files, and session links can end up in different places when you manage them separately.</p></article></div>''','wash')
content+=section('<div class="split"><div>'+eyebrow('Be part of a learning marketplace')+'<h2>Help seekers understand<br><span class="serif">what you can teach them.</span></h2><p>Your public profile puts your background, skills, languages, and portfolio alongside your programs. Seekers can search for programs or look for a provider by name.</p><p>Each program explains the outcomes, level, requirements, and schedule. This gives people useful information before they decide to book or send you a question.</p><p>After a completed enrollment, a seeker can leave a review. You can respond publicly, so future seekers can read both the feedback and your reply.</p></div><div class="panel"><span class="mini-label">Your public profile</span><h3>Show what is relevant to your subject</h3><ul class="feature-list light"><li>Professional and teaching experience</li><li>Skills, languages, and relevant qualifications</li><li>A portfolio with images, video, audio, or documents</li><li>Your programs and available seeker reviews</li></ul></div></div>')
content+=section('<div class="split" id="teaching-tools"><div>'+eyebrow('From idea to program')+'<h2>Explain the offer clearly.<br><span class="serif">Set the terms yourself.</span></h2><p>Choose the format, level, price, capacity, and schedule. Tell seekers what they will practise and what they need to bring. Save a draft and return to it when you are ready.</p><p>If writing the listing slows you down, describe the idea in a sentence. The optional AI writing assistant can suggest a title, description, and details supported by your prompt. Review and edit the result before publishing, or write everything yourself.</p><p>When you run a program again, add more start dates or duplicate it into a new draft. Repeating dates in a series share announcements, discussion, and one resource library.</p></div><div class="teacher-demo"><span class="demo-tag">Example program draft</span><div class="prompt-box">“A live online sketching program for beginners.”</div><div class="generated"><span class="mini-label">Review and edit before publishing</span><h3>Beginner Sketching Program Online</h3><p>Explain the exercises you will cover, the materials seekers need, and what they will practise.</p><span class="pill">Beginner</span><span class="pill">Online</span><span class="pill">Workshop format</span></div><p class="chat-hint">Illustrative draft. You choose the final details.</p></div></div>','wash')
content+=section(f'<div class="split"><div>{eyebrow("Run the program in one place")}<h2>Keep the admin<br><span class="serif">with the learning.</span></h2><p>Use the provider dashboard to manage programs, find enrolled seekers, check the calendar, and reply to messages. Reports show enrollments, reviews, and earnings for the dates you choose.</p><p>For an online session, start the built-in video room from the schedule. Share your screen, follow the session chat, and check seekers in. Upload supporting resources to the program so enrolled seekers can find them afterward.</p><ul class="feature-list"><li>Send official updates through announcements.</li><li>Keep group questions in program discussion.</li><li>Use private messages for individual questions.</li></ul>{link("Explore the program experience",u("/learning-experience/"))}</div>{classroom()}</div>','dark')
content+=section('<div id="provider-process">'+head('Becoming a provider','Start with your application.')+'<div class="steps provider-steps"><div class="step"><span class="number">01</span><h3>Tell us about your experience</h3><p>Apply from your account. Add your bio, background, skills, languages, and relevant qualifications or portfolio links.</p></div><div class="step"><span class="number">02</span><h3>Receive a review decision</h3><p>talent-share reviews provider applications. You are notified by email when your application is submitted and when a decision is made.</p></div><div class="step"><span class="number">03</span><h3>Prepare your first program</h3><p>Once approved, create your program, check the details, and publish it. Your profile and program help seekers decide whether to book.</p></div></div></div>')
content+=section(f'<div class="faq-grid"><div>{eyebrow("Before you apply")}<h2>Provider questions</h2><p>You can learn as a seeker and apply to become a provider with the same account.</p></div><div>{faq([FAQ[i] for i in [12,13,14,11]])}</div></div>','wash')
