# About
content=hero('About TalentShare','A place to<br><span class="serif">learn and teach.</span>','TalentShare connects people who want to learn with people who have something to teach. The exchange happens live, online or in person.','workshop','People learning pottery together',btn('Find something to learn',APP))
content+=section('<div class="reading"><h2>Learn directly from a teacher</h2><p>Learning with a teacher gives you the chance to ask questions and work through something you do not understand. You can watch a demonstration and practise during a live session.</p><p>TalentShare connects learners with teachers. Teachers create programs around what they know. Learners can read the details, choose a date, and attend a live session. Programs can take different forms, from a focused workshop or consultation to a course with several sessions.</p><h2>Online and in-person programs</h2><p>Online sessions run inside TalentShare. In-person programs bring people into the same physical space. Both have a program page that holds the schedule, booking details, resources, and conversations.</p><p>Announcements, private messages, class discussions, and course files are available through the program. You can check for updates and find shared materials without searching through separate email threads.</p><h2>Learn and teach with one account</h2><p>You might teach a skill you know well and learn something completely new the following week. The same account supports both. Learners can apply to teach, and approved teachers can keep learning through their own enrolled programs.</p><p>You can use TalentShare to learn, teach, or do both.</p><div class="actions">'+link('How the experience works',u('/learning-experience/'))+link('For providers',u('/teach/'))+'</div></div>')+closing()
page('/about/','About TalentShare | A Marketplace for Live Learning','TalentShare connects learners and teachers through live online and in-person programs. Learn about the marketplace and the experience built around each class.','about TalentShare',content)
